Irotaki otzimantayetari ochakopite, iroñaaka chakopipaye omanatantari.
Aparoni kitatiteri osaikinta Shintsivaki.
Ipoñaakakaro Shintsivaki, ikenakanakiro antamimashiki.
Poñaashitaka ankantashitavakya avisanaki osheki osarentsi osaikantakiri Lima [Irimashiki].
Yamenamintsatashitana kapicheeni, paita yamayetzi kapicheeni, isaiki nirentoki, yami paitarika novari.
Iroñaaka ipokapaji niri, ikantakiri: “Nonintakiro pishinto, kantzimaitacha opakenaro inirotsori, opakenaro irento, irotaki amakenarori novankoki.”
Notsipatakari osamanitanaki, tzimaki neentsite iro ipaitakinari, notzimantapakari quince nosarentsite.
Omapokashitakana, nosaiki nopishitziro novanko.
Tzimanaki aparonitanaki kitaiteri, viernestapaki pokaji noime.
Ipoña napiivetajya ipoña nantatzira osheki ejercicio, pyaanaka oyatsinka.
Ari yantakena, arika intzimanake neentsite, ari irora paita airo yamitakotana, inkantena inkivaronteri peentsite.
